Vendored components
-------------------

1. SynthV Agent Bridge runtime (server + in-app Lua executor)
   Source: https://github.com/SynthVCopilot/synthv-agent-bridge
   License: Apache-2.0
   - server/server.bundle.mjs
     Produced from the upstream `dist/src/cli.js` entry with:
       esbuild dist/src/cli.js --bundle --platform=node --format=esm \
         --target=node20 --outfile=server.bundle.mjs
     The bundle embeds the upstream runtime and its runtime dependencies
     (@modelcontextprotocol/sdk, zod). No source changes were made.
   - synthv/SynthVAgentBridge.lua
   - synthv/SynthVAgentSidebar.lua
   - synthv/StopSynthVAgentBridge.lua
     Upstream build templates. This plugin substitutes the
     "__SYNTHV_AGENT_EXECUTOR_BUILD_ID__" / "__SYNTHV_AGENT_SIDEBAR_BUILD_ID__"
     markers at install time using the upstream algorithm
     (sv3-lua-<version>-sha256(template)) and writes the upstream-compatible
     install manifest into the IPC directory. This is required for the Node
     server and the in-app executor to agree on the same build identity.

2. DSH Host integration, discovery, composition and DAW tooling in lib/ are
   original work of this plugin and are licensed Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE).

